{
  "info": {
    "name": "Loja API",
    "description": "Collection completa da Loja API (Spring Boot 3.4 + Java 21).\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Suba o backend: `./run-dev.sh` (base: http://localhost:8080)\n2. Configure o `baseUrl` nas variáveis da collection se necessário.\n3. Rode **Auth → Register User** e **Auth → Login (User)** — o token é salvo em `{{accessToken}}`.\n4. Para testar endpoints **ADMIN**, registre o admin, promova-o no banco e faça login:\n\n```sql\nUPDATE users SET role = 'ADMIN' WHERE email = 'admin@example.com';\n```\n\n5. Rode o restante na ordem: Products → Cart → Orders → Shipping/Payments → Admin.\n\n## Observações\n\n- Request bodies assumem **camelCase** (padrão Jackson/Java). Se sua API usar snake_case, ajuste os bodies.\n- Endpoints marcados `(ADMIN)` exigem token de usuário com role `ADMIN`.\n- Os scripts de teste guardam IDs automaticamente nas collection variables.\n- Actuator `/metrics` e `/prometheus` exigem autenticação; `/health` e `/info` são públicos.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl",      "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "accessToken",  "value": "" },
    { "key": "userEmail",    "value": "user@example.com" },
    { "key": "userPassword", "value": "senha12345" },
    { "key": "adminEmail",   "value": "admin@example.com" },
    { "key": "adminPassword","value": "senha12345" },
    { "key": "userId",       "value": "1" },
    { "key": "productId",    "value": "1" },
    { "key": "cartItemId",   "value": "1" },
    { "key": "orderId",      "value": "1" },
    { "key": "paymentId",    "value": "1" },
    { "key": "couponCode",   "value": "BEMVINDO10" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Cadastro e login. Endpoints públicos (noauth).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Usuário Teste\",\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "description": "Cria um usuário comum. Senha mínima: 8 caracteres. Retorna 409 se o e-mail já existir."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (User)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.access_token);",
                  "  console.log('User token salvo.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "description": "Retorna `access_token` (snake_case). O teste salva o token em `{{accessToken}}`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Admin Teste\",\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "description": "Cria o usuário admin. Depois de criado, promova-o no banco:\n\nUPDATE users SET role = 'ADMIN' WHERE email = 'admin@example.com';"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.access_token);",
                  "  console.log('Admin token salvo (substitui o token de usuário).');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "description": "Login do admin. SUBSTITUI `{{accessToken}}` — rode antes dos testes admin."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
